cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, please cite this repository and record the commit used. Cite LexGLUE separately for the benchmark."
type: software
title: "Small Language Model Benchmarking on ECtHR-A"
authors:
  - family-names: Jadhav
    given-names: Siddhesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/Siddhesh2612/ECtHR-A-small-language-model-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/Siddhesh2612/ECtHR-A-small-language-model-benchmark"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  MSc dissertation archive and research software for multi-label classification
  of European Court of Human Rights case facts using the ECtHR-A benchmark.
  Includes data preparation, configurable model fine-tuning, separate final
  evaluation and preserved historical notebook experiments. Historical reported
  scores are not claimed as reproduced by the new implementation; synthetic
  smoke-test results verify the workflow and are not benchmark findings.
keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - legal NLP
  - ECtHR-A
  - LexGLUE
  - multi-label classification
  - language model fine-tuning
  - reproducible research
